# Jazzer's GENERATED working corpus: machine-produced inputs it re-derives on
# every `:fuzz:fuzz` run. The corpus that belongs in git is the hand-written
# SEED corpus (fuzz/src/test/resources/**) plus any crash reproducer Jazzer
# writes there — see fuzz/README.md.
/fuzz/.cifuzz-corpus
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
